# PROJECT ORGANIZATION CLEANUP SPRINT

## Sprint Metadata
- **Type**: Cleanup / Reorganization
- **Risk Level**: Low (no code changes, only file operations)
- **Estimated Duration**: 2-3 sessions
- **Completion Date**: [TO BE FILLED]

---

## SCOPE CONTRACT 1: _project Folder Reorganization

**Goal**: Transform _project from cluttered flat structure (27 root items) into hierarchical, kebab-case, scannable organization

**In Scope**:
- Delete empty/placeholder files (DAILY_LOG.md, REFACTOR_BACKLOG.md)
- Archive abandoned folders (Evening work/, Research & Learn work/)
- Flatten single-file folders (_lessons/time-lessons/, _next-steps/, _presentation/, _priority processing & next steps/)
- Create new directory structure: sprints/active/, sprints/backlog/, bugs/, scope/, _archive/
- Rename all files to kebab-case convention
- Consolidate VFS-related TODOs (8 files → 3 max)
- Consolidate HOMEPAGE-related TODOs (5 files → 2 max)
- Preserve COMMANDS/ folder (already well-organized)
- Preserve SCOPE/TEMPLATE.md

**Out of Scope**:
- File content changes (only moves, renames, deletes)
- Code implementation
- New feature creation
- _handbook/ modifications (already clean)

---

