## SCOPE CONTRACT 4: Naming Convention Enforcement

**Goal**: 100% kebab-case compliance across all three folders

**In Scope**:
- Rename every file and folder to kebab-case
- Document exceptions (if any) in README.md

**Kebab-case Rules**:
- All lowercase
- Words separated by hyphens
- No spaces
- No underscores (except in _archive, _index by convention)
- No UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
- No PascalCase
- No Title Case

