## RISK MITIGATION

**Risk**: Accidental file deletion
**Mitigation**: Git backup branch created before any operations; all deletions logged; rollback plan documented

**Risk**: Broken internal links (files referencing each other)
**Mitigation**: Search for internal references before moves; update if found; primarily affects COMMANDS/ which is not being moved

**Risk**: Losing track of active vs completed work
**Mitigation**: Only _project-done/ touched in Phase 3; active work stays in _project/ until explicitly archived

**Risk**: Inconsistent naming during transition
**Mitigation**: Phase 5 dedicated naming sweep after all moves complete

