## NOTES

**Naming Convention Decisions**:
- _archive/ prefix with underscore: acceptable (indicates special/system folder)
- _index.md prefix with underscore: acceptable (indicates generated/system file)
- All other files/folders: strict kebab-case

**Consolidation Decisions**:
- VFS-related: 8 files → 3 files (migration-integration, gap-closure, automated-mapping)
- HOMEPAGE-related: 5 files → 3 files (design-system, testing, layout-rwd)

**Archive Decisions**:
- Evening work/: 2025 content, likely abandoned → archive
- Research & Learn work/: superseded by _contexts/ → archive
- later/: mix of old sprints → archive
